WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.493 --> 00:00:20.906
First, what your sheet needs to look like.

2
00:00:20.906 --> 00:00:26.911
Three columns: Last name, First name, Phone.

3
00:00:26.911 --> 00:00:33.141
The phone column is optional — a blank cell is fine.

4
00:00:33.141 --> 00:00:45.467
No other columns, one attendee per row. Save it as .csv or .xlsx.

5
00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:49.275
Everything an instructor does starts from the kiosk.

6
00:00:49.275 --> 00:00:56.564
Tap Instructor, in the row under the two big buttons.

7
00:00:56.564 --> 00:00:59.756
The panel is behind your instructor PIN.

8
00:00:59.756 --> 00:01:03.980
Face ID is the shortcut — the PIN is what actually opens it.

9
00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:10.002
Type your six digits.

10
00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:15.390
Then tap Unlock.

11
00:01:15.390 --> 00:01:20.972
This is the Instructor Panel. Five tabs across the top.

12
00:01:20.972 --> 00:01:26.750
Open the Upload tab.

13
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:33.848
The app shows the same three columns, so you can check as you go.

14
00:01:33.848 --> 00:01:40.284
Existing attendees are matched and merged, never duplicated.

15
00:01:40.284 --> 00:01:47.089
Tap Choose File and pick your sheet.

16
00:01:47.089 --> 00:01:54.967
The summary says what was added and what was already there.
